  IconPath: systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/background.svg
  Description: After an altercation with an undead creature, you feared you might
    be infected. Either through medical intervention, luck, or misunderstanding how
    undeath spreads, your fears abated. However, your brush with living death taught
    you the value of life. You do whatever you can to avoid the end you thought you'd
    been fated. Choose two attribute boosts. One must be to Dexterity or Wisdom ,
    and one is a free attribute boost. You're trained in the Medicine skill and the
    Undead Lore skill. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.Item.Battle Medicine]
    skill feat.
